Package: vajra
Version: 1.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ritik Suman <https://github.com/Ritiksuman07>
Homepage: https://github.com/Ritiksuman07/Vajra
Description: Local-first AI agent workspace
 Vajra is an offline-first AI agent workspace written in Go. It ships a
 terminal UI, a web GUI and a REST API that talk to local model servers
 such as Ollama. No telemetry, no cloud dependency.
